<title>UK: LME delists some U.S. delivery points.</title>
<headline>LME delists some U.S. delivery points.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) has delisted Bridgeport and New York/New Jersey as good delivery points with immediate effect, an Exchange notice said.</p>
<p>New York/New Jersey had been approved to hold all LME metals and Bridgeport all but copper. There was no metal currently being held in either delivery point.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
